5     How Events of Various Sports Impact the Results?
      微




5.1    Establishment of Indicators
    This section aims to investigate the influence of events on the outcomes of the Olympic Games.
Specifically, we seek to determine whether the number of events within each discipline for each
Olympic game, as well as the types of events, affect the performance of participating countries,
thereby impacting the overall medal standings.
                                                              Team 2524070                                                                               Page 15of 25


